{
    "name":  "regress_shadowlara_50e",
    "description":  "Test 50e: as 50d_nolook (outfit 14/14, rock vein, chart, TruRockVein 0.8, TruShadowPower 0.8 with [Look] Enabled=0, TruMenu 0.7) with doppelganger_casual from work/rebuild/dlc_test50e_vm: the heap crash of 50b / 50d / 50d_nolook / 50d_nojump (tru+0x1982b6 / +0x1982ef) was a value-stack underflow of the state-program VM (tru+0x32b20) - three code words of DTP 26870 and two of DTP 22309 were not byte-swapped by the converter (push / jz lost), the program wrote below its 0x200-byte stack into the heap boundary tag (tools/statevm_check.py); fixed to the Xbox words. Also the two event-list records of sub type 0x32 (player events 0x87 / 0x85 in DTP 20172) carry a u32 section id (26764 / 26765) instead of swapped u16 halves (tools/eventlist_idword_fix.py). CHECK: wall run, then death / reload - no crash. Arms / gloves NOT fixed yet (note what you see). Run WITH -Debugger.",
